WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.083
In the previous verses,

2
00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:33.083
we learned that a true yogi's

3
00:00:33.083 --> 00:00:35.250
perspective itself changes.

4
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:37.791
They see Lord Krishna in everyone,

5
00:00:37.791 --> 00:00:40.375
and they see all beings in Lord Krishna.

6
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:41.041
Such a yogi

7
00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:43.875
is then never separate from Lord Krishna.

8
00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:46.833
Now here, Lord Krishna explains

9
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:49.500
how that yogi views others

10
00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:51.458
in comparison to themselves.

11
00:00:56.583 --> 00:00:59.583
In this verse, Lord Krishna clarifies

12
00:00:59.583 --> 00:01:00.791
that a perfected yogi

13
00:01:00.791 --> 00:01:01.916
holds the same feeling toward others

14
00:01:01.916 --> 00:01:03.791
as they hold

15
00:01:03.791 --> 00:01:06.041
for themselves.

16
00:01:06.041 --> 00:01:08.666
This is a deep spiritual experience,

17
00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:11.875
according to which, externally, however
 different all beings may be,

18
00:01:11.875 --> 00:01:13.791
they also experience

19
00:01:13.791 --> 00:01:16.416
happiness and sorrow

20
00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:18.375
in exactly the same way

21
00:01:18.375 --> 00:01:21.000
as that yogi experiences themselves.

22
00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.666
Humans, animals, birds, etc. –

23
00:01:23.666 --> 00:01:24.583
a perfected yogi

24
00:01:24.583 --> 00:01:26.875
sees all as equal to themselves.

25
00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:29.583
They believe that this entire world and all its

26
00:01:29.583 --> 00:01:33.000
beings are connected to each other by one bond.

27
00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:35.875
A yogi believes that every being,

28
00:01:35.875 --> 00:01:37.791
just like them, wants happiness

29
00:01:37.791 --> 00:01:40.208
and is desirous of staying away from sorrow.

30
00:01:40.208 --> 00:01:41.875
This very thinking creates in them

31
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:44.208
a feeling of compassion for all.

32
00:01:44.208 --> 00:01:46.625
In this chapter, we had learned earlier

33
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:49.791
that the purpose of yoga is self-realization,

34
00:01:49.791 --> 00:01:51.083
and a yogi

35
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:53.750
becomes free from the sufferings of the world.

36
00:01:53.750 --> 00:01:55.000
But now here,

37
00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.875
we are understanding one more

38
00:01:56.875 --> 00:01:58.375
excellent level of yoga.

39
00:01:58.375 --> 00:02:00.041
Lord Krishna here emphasizes

40
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:02.125
yoga's two best qualities –

41
00:02:02.125 --> 00:02:04.458
compassion and sensitivity.

42
00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:06.583
Meaning, the yogi's purpose is

43
00:02:06.583 --> 00:02:08.291
not only self-realization

44
00:02:08.291 --> 00:02:09.750
or freedom from sufferings,

45
00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:10.541
but

46
00:02:10.541 --> 00:02:11.833
they are also sensitive

47
00:02:11.833 --> 00:02:14.000
toward the welfare of others.

48
00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:17.083
Meaning, one cannot become a supreme yogi

49
00:02:17.083 --> 00:02:20.250
who does yoga only for personal peace.

50
00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.000
Only they

51
00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.208
will become a supreme yogi

52
00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.041
who considers others' sorrow as their own sorrow

53
00:02:25.041 --> 00:02:28.583
and makes efforts toward their welfare.

54
00:02:28.583 --> 00:02:30.083
The message of this verse

55
00:02:30.083 --> 00:02:32.916
is very important for personal life.

56
00:02:32.916 --> 00:02:35.750
Spirituality or yoga's purpose is not only

57
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.750
personal,

58
00:02:36.750 --> 00:02:38.208
but its purpose is also

59
00:02:38.208 --> 00:02:40.583
compassion toward others.

60
00:02:40.583 --> 00:02:43.041
And one who walks on this path with true heart

61
00:02:43.041 --> 00:02:45.833
keeps empathy toward all beings,

62
00:02:45.833 --> 00:02:47.666
understands their sorrow,

63
00:02:47.666 --> 00:02:50.833
and tries to remove others' sorrow.

64
00:02:50.833 --> 00:02:56.333
They live a life of kindness, 
charity, and social welfare.

65
00:03:01.541 --> 00:03:03.458
A person

66
00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:07.708
often quickly pays attention to others' faults,

67
00:03:07.708 --> 00:03:09.833
sees only their mistakes,

68
00:03:09.833 --> 00:03:13.708
comments on their lifestyle,

69
00:03:13.708 --> 00:03:15.416
about how other people

70
00:03:15.416 --> 00:03:19.000
are making decisions in the wrong way.

71
00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:21.791
There are many such examples.

72
00:03:21.791 --> 00:03:25.916
And ordinarily, such comments

73
00:03:25.916 --> 00:03:28.875
are negative.

74
00:03:28.875 --> 00:03:32.333
But a yogi

75
00:03:32.333 --> 00:03:34.166
sees others with a vision of

76
00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:37.583
compassion and sensitivity.

77
00:03:37.583 --> 00:03:39.791
Because they know

78
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:42.208
every person has their own separate

79
00:03:42.208 --> 00:03:45.666
journey, their own circumstances,

80
00:03:45.666 --> 00:03:51.291
everyone is going through some suffering of life.

81
00:03:51.291 --> 00:03:53.458
Think –

82
00:03:53.458 --> 00:03:58.041
no one knowingly makes wrong decisions,

83
00:03:58.041 --> 00:04:02.250
knowingly invites sorrow.

84
00:04:02.250 --> 00:04:06.833
Everyone wants right decisions and happiness.

85
00:04:06.833 --> 00:04:10.916
When you look at others with this vision,

86
00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:14.041
you start understanding their
 behavior, their decisions,

87
00:04:14.041 --> 00:04:17.833
and their difficulties.

88
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:21.166
Then instead of commenting on them

89
00:04:21.166 --> 00:04:24.208
or criticizing them,

90
00:04:24.208 --> 00:04:28.625
empathy awakens in your mind for them.

91
00:04:28.625 --> 00:04:30.708
The feeling of encouraging

92
00:04:30.708 --> 00:04:34.375
and supporting them awakens in you.

93
00:04:34.375 --> 00:04:37.500
So next time if someone's behavior

94
00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.750
or conduct seems wrong to you or hurts you,

95
00:04:41.750 --> 00:04:46.875
just stop once and think this much:

96
00:04:46.875 --> 00:04:48.041
"Do you know

97
00:04:48.041 --> 00:04:53.333
all the struggles of that person's life?”

98
00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:54.500
Who knows,

99
00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:57.625
their circumstances might be so bad

100
00:04:57.625 --> 00:05:02.458
that their conduct is being affected?

101
00:05:02.458 --> 00:05:04.416
You too must have made some mistake

102
00:05:04.416 --> 00:05:08.875
during bad times?

103
00:05:08.875 --> 00:05:10.416
This thought

104
00:05:10.416 --> 00:05:14.291
will awaken sensitivity in you.

105
00:05:14.291 --> 00:05:19.250
You'll stop before getting angry at others.

106
00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:20.750
You'll try to understand

107
00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.958
their perspective.

108
00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:25.916
Instead of negativity in the mind,

109
00:05:25.916 --> 00:05:29.625
the feeling to help them will come.

110
00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:31.375
Think –

111
00:05:31.375 --> 00:05:35.750
if you were going through some struggle,

112
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:37.375
you would also

113
00:05:37.375 --> 00:05:40.583
expect such treatment, right?

114
00:05:40.583 --> 00:05:42.958
So just think about this,

115
00:05:42.958 --> 00:05:49.791
and keep negativity toward others away.

116
00:05:54.625 --> 00:05:57.208
Family is such a place

117
00:05:57.208 --> 00:05:59.791
where some people of different ages,

118
00:05:59.791 --> 00:06:02.666
different perspectives,

119
00:06:02.666 --> 00:06:07.750
different thinking live under one roof.

120
00:06:07.750 --> 00:06:09.625
It's natural that

121
00:06:09.625 --> 00:06:13.250
parents will think differently from children,

122
00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:17.083
husband-wife's thinking will also differ,

123
00:06:17.083 --> 00:06:19.541
family elders will think

124
00:06:19.541 --> 00:06:23.458
according to their personal experiences.

125
00:06:23.458 --> 00:06:26.500
In such a case, situation of difference
 of opinion arising

126
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:28.541
is a simple matter.

127
00:06:28.541 --> 00:06:31.791
But at the time of difference,

128
00:06:31.791 --> 00:06:35.750
the easiest and most wrong thing is –

129
00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.500
getting angry,

130
00:06:37.500 --> 00:06:39.958
thinking bad about others.

131
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:41.333
For living lovingly

132
00:06:41.333 --> 00:06:44.875
in the family, it's not essential

133
00:06:44.875 --> 00:06:48.000
that everyone's thinking be the same.

134
00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:52.500
What's needed is mutual 
understanding, compassion

135
00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.041
and sensitivity.

136
00:06:55.041 --> 00:06:59.625
You just stop for a few moments and think –

137
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:03.083
"Why does someone else think like this?

138
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:07.333
They also don't want to make wrong decisions.

139
00:07:07.333 --> 00:07:10.583
At their age and in their circumstances,

140
00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:13.750
would you also think like them?"

141
00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:14.583
These questions

142
00:07:14.583 --> 00:07:17.750
will make you understand others' perspectives,

143
00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.625
awaken sensitivity, and also

144
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:24.833
inspire to find the right solution.

145
00:07:24.833 --> 00:07:29.000
Now your reaction will be 
based not on anger or ego,

146
00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.833
 but on love and understanding.

147
00:07:32.833 --> 00:07:34.416
And this change

148
00:07:34.416 --> 00:07:38.083
can make every relationship better.

149
00:07:38.083 --> 00:07:41.541
When you try to understand others,

150
00:07:41.541 --> 00:07:45.833
they will also respect your feelings.

151
00:07:45.833 --> 00:07:49.791
Unity and love in family

152
00:07:49.791 --> 00:07:52.458
come only from accepting each other like this.

153
00:07:57.375 --> 00:08:00.500
A professional organization

154
00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:05.041
is a gathering of many different kinds of people.

155
00:08:05.041 --> 00:08:09.041
Everyone has different purposes, 
their own personality,

156
00:08:09.041 --> 00:08:11.166
their own weaknesses,

157
00:08:11.166 --> 00:08:13.708
their own strengths.

158
00:08:13.708 --> 00:08:19.708
And all these people have to work together.

159
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:22.583
Many times people make mistakes,

160
00:08:22.583 --> 00:08:26.250
or they don't work according to your expectations,

161
00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:32.041
or your and their thinking becomes different.

162
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:34.625
So in such a case, what should be done?

163
00:08:34.625 --> 00:08:38.125
Is criticism and blame-placing right?

164
00:08:38.125 --> 00:08:40.666
Or should one work with sensitivity

165
00:08:40.666 --> 00:08:43.333
and understanding?

166
00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:46.375
Especially in leadership positions,
 taking the right decision

167
00:08:46.375 --> 00:08:48.958
is extremely important.

168
00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:50.375
Suppose

169
00:08:50.375 --> 00:08:51.708
a colleague

170
00:08:51.708 --> 00:08:55.916
couldn't complete an important task on time.

171
00:08:55.916 --> 00:08:59.000
The easiest reaction would be –

172
00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:00.458
getting angry,

173
00:09:00.458 --> 00:09:04.958
especially when work pressure is high.

174
00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:10.208
But if you stop and think for a moment,

175
00:09:10.208 --> 00:09:12.083
you might get

176
00:09:12.083 --> 00:09:14.416
a different perspective.

177
00:09:14.416 --> 00:09:15.750
Maybe

178
00:09:15.750 --> 00:09:17.458
they're personally in

179
00:09:17.458 --> 00:09:19.583
some big difficulty,

180
00:09:19.583 --> 00:09:24.791
maybe work pressure on them was too much,

181
00:09:24.791 --> 00:09:28.208
or it may also be that they lack capability

182
00:09:28.208 --> 00:09:31.750
and seriousness.

183
00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:34.916
Now this thinking, instead of anger,

184
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:36.916
takes your mind toward solution

185
00:09:36.916 --> 00:09:39.958
and empathy.

186
00:09:39.958 --> 00:09:42.500
If their personal problem was there,

187
00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:44.791
show empathy.

188
00:09:44.791 --> 00:09:46.666
If work pressure was there,

189
00:09:46.666 --> 00:09:48.791
help can be provided.

190
00:09:48.791 --> 00:09:52.041
If there was lack of seriousness or capability,

191
00:09:52.041 --> 00:09:54.208
they can be taught,

192
00:09:54.208 --> 00:09:59.333
and the importance of their 
work can be explained.

193
00:09:59.333 --> 00:10:01.375
When you understand others,

194
00:10:01.375 --> 00:10:02.666
they too will

195
00:10:02.666 --> 00:10:06.291
take their responsibility seriously.

196
00:10:06.291 --> 00:10:10.583
Therefore, put sensitivity in place of anger,

197
00:10:10.583 --> 00:10:15.625
put cooperation in place of criticism.

198
00:10:15.625 --> 00:10:18.541
If this thinking comes in everyone,

199
00:10:18.541 --> 00:10:20.916
that organization's progress

200
00:10:20.916 --> 00:10:23.500
no one can stop,

201
00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.416
Because in such an organization,

202
00:10:25.416 --> 00:10:29.166
everyone's purpose is to find solutions,

203
00:10:29.166 --> 00:10:33.125
not to find faults in others.

204
00:10:33.125 --> 00:10:35.541
Think about this.
